          "es": "En su patita, bien apretada, había una bolita de tierra.",
          "en": "In his tiny paw, held tight, was a little ball of earth."
        },
        {
          "es": "Era el animal más chico de todos, e hizo lo que nadie más pudo.",
          "en": "He was the smallest of them all, and he did what no one else could."
